# Install and usage

Install `mgba_libretro_android.so` as a libretro core on an Android ARM64
device. Load a compatible GBA Wi-Fi Link title with the core and use the
standard frontend host/client flow for multiplayer.

This release is built from `{{repository}}` tag `{{tag}}`.

See `SOURCE-AND-PROVENANCE.md` and `RELEASE-PROVENANCE.json` for the recorded
source and build identities.

This experimental alpha is published automatically from its approved annotated
tag after the release workflow verifies the complete artifact set. A correction
uses a newly reviewed version and tag; published assets are not replaced.
